{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Little Chef: Cozy Cooking</strong></i>, each level is a cozy puzzle sandbox set in its own unique kitchen. You\u2019ll unlock recipes by experimenting with ingredients, mastering hands-on cooking mechanics, and solving environment-based puzzles designed around the space itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/fa5b78fd19a7d7d92f7cb0f7ca909037.poster.avif?t=1773666014\" aria-label=\"A gif of a sweet croissant being made by tossing a croissant and nutella into the oven.\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/fa5b78fd19a7d7d92f7cb0f7ca909037.webm?t=1773666014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook everything from comfort foods and gourmet dishes to strange, surprising experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with satisfying physics as every ingredient and object reacts in fun, surprising ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve playful kitchen puzzles to uncover hidden ingredients, secrets, and new ways to cook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fun achievements that reward curiosity, chaos, and breaking the rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a heartfelt story by unlocking each recipe, from childhood favourites to brand-new creations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIX &amp; MATCH INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag, drop, toss, or gently place ingredients into pots, ovens, and pans. Combining the right ones unlocks new recipes, good and bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/d58c1ede755d8971e736d28ebeff6e8a.poster.avif?t=1773666014\" aria-label=\"A gif of banana pancakes being made by tossing milk, banana and eggs into the pot.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/d58c1ede755d8971e736d28ebeff6e8a.webm?t=1773666014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH PHYSICS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything has weight, motion and personality. Drag and drop items, or throw them around. Explore, experiment, and see what secrets you can uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/3b85ca22a81af1858be3e2f48a529443.poster.avif?t=1773666014\" aria-label=\"A gif of books being picked up out of the book shelf and dropped.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/3b85ca22a81af1858be3e2f48a529443.webm?t=1773666014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE COZY PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all ingredients are easy to find. Some are hidden, others are locked away, and solving these puzzles might mean thinking creatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d6f795a04d78afebd5c5bbb69f96356.poster.avif?t=1773666014\" aria-label=\"A gif of a coffee can being dragged left and right, pouring out a lot of coffee\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d6f795a04d78afebd5c5bbb69f96356.webm?t=1773666014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Lot to the Right","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/17d926dd121a5b9a25c780c22846bb89fa47705d.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Disaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/978ba8ccf46b03b6fd9b5140bb28c89aa1df4599.jpg"},{"name":"Squeaky Clean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/e745158ceee1afaada3f4e17649c0d29ed075782.jpg"},{"name":"Master Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/6caea37f502f92e7875a40ad2c737eccc7cfedae.jpg"},{"name":"Post A Lot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/4ee5e77776d8214f19763d8baa4e546f6d25b1fc.jpg"},{"name":"To Infinity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/1e2b8f777c503aeca1036f868fedf59d0ffa0faa.jpg"},{"name":"I Smell Cheese","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/3c5b03c439752deddb19b8c30abca58594191ff4.jpg"},{"name":"Fair Trade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/0fc0b03c8514a3bced1becb658d2d811df1e1ee6.jpg"},{"name":"What's The Emergency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3376500/272c4c56fd927b83ed9391a219a0ec971178dd25.jpg"},{"name":"Tilted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni