as weight, motion and personality. Drag and drop items, or throw them around. Explore, experiment, and see what secrets you can uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/3b85ca22a81af1858be3e2f48a529443.poster.avif?t=1773666014\" aria-label=\"A gif of books being picked up out of the book shelf and dropped.\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/3b85ca22a81af1858be3e2f48a529443.webm?t=1773666014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE COZY PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all ingredients are easy to find. Some are hidden, others are locked away, and solving these puzzles might mean thinking creatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d6f795a04d78afebd5c5bbb69f96356.poster.avif?t=1773666014\" aria-label=\"A gif of a coffee can being dragged left and right, pouring out a lot of coffee\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d6f795a04d78afebd5c5bbb69f96356.webm?t=1773666014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Julien Truebiger","Hello Erika","Danny van Duist"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500